@base = http://127.0.0.1:18081

### Service status
GET {{base}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Echo a JSON request
# @name echo_quote
POST {{base}}/echo
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
X-Example: OpenPyCharm

{"message":"你好 OpenPyCharm 🚀","quantity":2}

### Raw binary response
GET {{base}}/binary
